5	The Company acquired control on Xmold  with effect from April 1, 2025, consequently, there are no corresponding figures for the consolidated financial results for the quarter ended September 30, 2024 and the previous year ended March 31, 2025. &lt;BR&gt; 
6	The Group operates in 'Styrenics and Allied Products' which in the context of Ind AS-108 "Operating Segments" and in the opinion of the Chief Operating Decision Maker constitutes a single reportable business segment.  &lt;BR&gt; 
7	Finance cost significantly comprises of interest expense on lease pertaining to Ind AS 116-Leases. The Company continues to remain debt free. &lt;BR&gt; 
8	The Company does not have any associates or joint ventures. &lt;BR&gt; 
